  "duration_s": 607.737007,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "您知道中国十大令人惊叹的峡谷秘境都有哪些吗？上集，咱们聊了金丝峡、巫山小三峡、马岭河、京口大峡谷和天山大峡谷。这一集直接揭开谜底，看看前五名惊叹到什么程度。尤其是排在榜首的那条雪山森林咆哮的大江全挤在一道谷里，他却一直活在一个更响亮的名字背后。第五名，恩师大峡谷，湖北恩师这一条您别当峡谷看它更像一口。把喀斯特奇观一股脑塞进去的大箱子，整条峡谷长一百零八公里，绝壁最高四百多米。您站在崖边对面，立着一根石柱子，拔地一百五十米，当地人叫他一柱香拔像，一柱香插在山上，再往里走。有一道地缝窄的两边岩壁几乎贴着肩膀，还有溶洞，天坑一个接一个冒出来。这些都是雨水顺着石灰岩的缝一点点融出来的别的峡谷是一道井，这是一整套自然奇观。同时摆在您面前。单拎出哪一样，别处都能当招牌，他偏偏全凑齐了，您说绝不绝。第四名，怒江大峡谷，云南怒江。他不像一个景区，更像以整个巨大的自然世界。怒江从青藏高原一路往南冲，夹在高黎贡山和怒山之间，峡谷三百来公里，两岸的山比谷底高出两千多米。你想想那种地方隔着江喊的硬话，走过去却要大半天。所以这里的人过去是挂一根钢缆六过江去几十秒，就到对岸峡谷里，住着隶粟族、怒族、独龙族好几个民族。到了丙中洛藏传佛教的寺天主教堂，基督教堂挨着盖在一起，各过各的节，谁也不碍着谁。您说这算不算一个装得下山，装得下江，还装得下人间烟火的大世界。第三名，虎跳峡，云南金沙江。您想象一下，两座五千多米的雪山面对面站着，中间只留一道缝，金沙江被硬生生挤了进去。左边是玉龙雪山，右边是哈巴雪山峡谷，全长十六公里，江水一路往下摔，江差两百多米。十八处险滩接连进去，江心有一块大石石头，传说老虎就是踩着他跳过了。江江面最窄的地方也就三十来米。您站在江边轰鸣声，像一列火车从脚底碾过去，几里外都听得见雪山，压着大江顶的，谁也不肯让，就这么夹出了一条会吼的峡谷，可就是这样的虎跳匣，居然还进不了前二。很多人心里他就是当之无愧的峡谷之王。长达五百零四公里，最深处达六千零九米，环绕着七千七百多米的南加巴瓦峰，画出了一个惊天动地的大拐弯。印度洋暖湿气流顺着这条世界第一大峡谷逆流而上，在青藏高原东南原硬生生劈开了一条绿色通道，造就了从极地冰原到热带雨林的九个完整垂直自然带。您站在观景台上，脚下是奔涌咆哮的江水，眼前是直刺蓝天的雪山，雄风与茫茫林海，他的大足以装下整座自然博物馆。可正因为人人都知道他天下第一真正压轴的那条，才更让人倒吸一口凉气。那第一名到底是哪儿？先别急，聊到这儿，我先唠几句心里话。我发现经常有朋友留言说，年轻时候忙，没空出门，现在退休有空了，想去走走，可不知道先去哪儿去了，看什么。还有朋友说，这些大峡谷大多藏在偏远的深山里，海拔高路又远，这辈子怕是没几处走得进去，有没有不用针跋山涉水，也能把他们看明白的办法？还有带孙子孙女的，想给孩子讲讲的江水，是怎么把大山劈开的？这些深谷到底是怎么长出来的？可自己也说不太明白，您看咱们这个年纪的翻，不光是图个热闹，更想知道这道深谷是怎么来的，背后有什么讲究。可这些东西在手机上划完就忘上网，查一堆乱七八糟的翻大布头，又看的眼睛疼。又是前阵子，我翻到一本书，正好解决这个问题，叫大美中国人一生要去的一百零一个地方。他把全中国最值得去的一百零一个地方挑出来，分成五块自然奇观，文明印记、烟火，人间秘境，寻踪，人间天堂。咱们今天聊的这些大峡谷书里头，一个地方接一个地方，将这条生生谷是怎样怎么被江水一年一年切出来的山上的冰川，又是怎么把谷底越拉越深的鼓里，住着哪些人走着哪条古道几分钟，一个地方讲的明明白白，图印的特别透亮。一页翻开就是一幅大画，我自己是这么用的，能去的地方出门前翻一翻到了地方，心里有底，看的就不只是一道深沟，而是几千万年攒下来的一件大作品。暂时去不了的，就着图文慢慢看，也算去过了。摆在茶几上，孙辈来了，翻两页，长见识不说，写作文也正好用得上。老两口晚上翻翻商量，明年去哪儿比刷手机舒坦多了，房子会旧积蓄会花完。可这些大峡谷里记着的山河来历，传多少代都贬不了职。这是大自然和老祖宗一起给咱们攒下的家底，一旦断了，可就不好结了，趁现在还能买到给自己，也给下一代留一份，说我搁商品橱窗了。感兴趣的朋友点开我的头像，进入主页进去看看，暂时走不出去，咱就把大好河山装进屋里好说。回正题揭晓，第一名帕龙藏布大峡谷为什么是他在几乎所有人的预料里，雅鲁藏布大峡谷都是无法撼动的榜首。可偏偏在很多真正走遍西藏的探险家眼里，这条知名度极低的大峡谷，才是全中国最不可思议的终极秘境。它全长七十六公里，平均深度超过四千米。最核心的地方，他就发源并横穿于中国最大的海洋性冰川发育区。波密与冉吾一带，在他的两岸密布着米堆冰川、弱果、冰川等数十条巨大兵蛇从皑皑雪峰上一路倾泻，甚至直接插进谷底。郁郁葱葱的原始云山林里，高耸入云的极寒雪峰，银白夺目的世纪冰川奔腾如脱缰野马的翡翠色急流，加上浓得化不开的原始丛林，在最紧凑的空间里撞出最极致的反差。所以他排第一，不是因为他最大，而是因为他同时装下雪山、冰川、森林和大江。他把世间最壮烈、最纯粹的雪山秘境感浓缩到了极致。十座峡谷讲完了金丝霞，把秦岭写成水墨小三峡，流淌着巴楚失意，马岭河百铺齐飞，京口大峡谷，绝壁千仞、天山红岩如烈火。恩施、奇峰、耸入云。怒江奔腾出洪荒，虎跳峡，在雪山下疯狂咆哮，雅鲁藏布以六千米及深作用，万物可只有帕龙藏布在冰川与密林的缝隙里，守着大自然最原始的秘境尊严。您说什么叫令人惊叹？最惊叹的往往不是世人皆知的壮阔，而而是那些藏在天地尽头，哪怕没被俗世记住，也依然美的惊心动魄的大地奇迹。最后问您一句，这十座大峡谷，您去过哪几座？您觉得哪一座最称得上奇迹？刚才说的那本大美中国，我歌商品橱窗了，点开我的头像，进入主页里就能找到喜欢大山大河的朋友别错过，想听更多藏在山河里的中国故事。点个关注，咱们下回接着聊。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00001",
      "start_ms": 290,
      "end_ms": 4350,
      "text": "您知道中国十大令人惊叹的峡谷秘境都有哪些吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00002",
      "start_ms": 4710,
      "end_ms": 5250,
      "text": "上集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00003",
      "start_ms": 5270,
      "end_ms": 12130,
      "text": "咱们聊了金丝峡、巫山小三峡、马岭河、京口大峡谷和天山大峡谷。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00004",
      "start_ms": 12650,
      "end_ms": 14930,
      "text": "这一集直接揭开谜底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00005",
      "start_ms": 15230,
      "end_ms": 18050,
      "text": "看看前五名惊叹到什么程度。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00006",
      "start_ms": 18570,
      "end_ms": 27030,
      "text": "尤其是排在榜首的那条雪山森林咆哮的大江全挤在一道谷里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00007",
      "start_ms": 27290,
      "end_ms": 31140,
      "text": "他却一直活在一个更响亮的名字背后。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00008",
      "start_ms": 31480,
      "end_ms": 32200,
      "text": "第五名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00009",
      "start_ms": 32560,
      "end_ms": 33940,
      "text": "恩师大峡谷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00010",
      "start_ms": 34200,
      "end_ms": 40060,
      "text": "湖北恩师这一条您别当峡谷看它更像一口。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00011",
      "start_ms": 40060,
      "end_ms": 43280,
      "text": "把喀斯特奇观一股脑塞进去的大箱子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00012",
      "start_ms": 43760,
      "end_ms": 47040,
      "text": "整条峡谷长一百零八公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00013",
      "start_ms": 47580,
      "end_ms": 49560,
      "text": "绝壁最高四百多米。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00014",
      "start_ms": 49820,
      "end_ms": 52140,
      "text": "您站在崖边对面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00015",
      "start_ms": 52240,
      "end_ms": 53800,
      "text": "立着一根石柱子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00016",
      "start_ms": 54000,
      "end_ms": 55780,
      "text": "拔地一百五十米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00017",
      "start_ms": 55980,
      "end_ms": 59200,
      "text": "当地人叫他一柱香拔像，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00018",
      "start_ms": 59340,
      "end_ms": 61305,
      "text": "一柱香插在山上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00019",
      "start_ms": 61790,
      "end_ms": 62825,
      "text": "再往里走。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00020",
      "start_ms": 63200,
      "end_ms": 67775,
      "text": "有一道地缝窄的两边岩壁几乎贴着肩膀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00021",
      "start_ms": 68370,
      "end_ms": 69325,
      "text": "还有溶洞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00022",
      "start_ms": 69690,
      "end_ms": 72075,
      "text": "天坑一个接一个冒出来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00023",
      "start_ms": 72530,
      "end_ms": 78805,
      "text": "这些都是雨水顺着石灰岩的缝一点点融出来的别的峡谷是一道井，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00024",
      "start_ms": 79180,
      "end_ms": 81180,
      "text": "这是一整套自然奇观。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00025",
      "start_ms": 81320,
      "end_ms": 82925,
      "text": "同时摆在您面前。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00026",
      "start_ms": 83360,
      "end_ms": 84625,
      "text": "单拎出哪一样，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00027",
      "start_ms": 84930,
      "end_ms": 86225,
      "text": "别处都能当招牌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00028",
      "start_ms": 86730,
      "end_ms": 88305,
      "text": "他偏偏全凑齐了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00029",
      "start_ms": 88610,
      "end_ms": 89355,
      "text": "您说绝不绝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00030",
      "start_ms": 89780,
      "end_ms": 90605,
      "text": "第四名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00031",
      "start_ms": 91230,
      "end_ms": 92455,
      "text": "怒江大峡谷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00032",
      "start_ms": 92990,
      "end_ms": 93985,
      "text": "云南怒江。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00033",
      "start_ms": 94540,
      "end_ms": 96235,
      "text": "他不像一个景区，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00034",
      "start_ms": 96910,
      "end_ms": 100555,
      "text": "更像以整个巨大的自然世界。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00035",
      "start_ms": 100960,
      "end_ms": 103675,
      "text": "怒江从青藏高原一路往南冲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00036",
      "start_ms": 104300,
      "end_ms": 106565,
      "text": "夹在高黎贡山和怒山之间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00037",
      "start_ms": 107140,
      "end_ms": 108545,
      "text": "峡谷三百来公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00038",
      "start_ms": 109030,
      "end_ms": 111655,
      "text": "两岸的山比谷底高出两千多米。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00039",
      "start_ms": 112090,
      "end_ms": 116190,
      "text": "你想想那种地方隔着江喊的硬话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00040",
      "start_ms": 116410,
      "end_ms": 118065,
      "text": "走过去却要大半天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00041",
      "start_ms": 118490,
      "end_ms": 124360,
      "text": "所以这里的人过去是挂一根钢缆六过江去几十秒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00042",
      "start_ms": 124520,
      "end_ms": 126300,
      "text": "就到对岸峡谷里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00043",
      "start_ms": 126300,
      "end_ms": 130460,
      "text": "住着隶粟族、怒族、独龙族好几个民族。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00044",
      "start_ms": 131000,
      "end_ms": 134720,
      "text": "到了丙中洛藏传佛教的寺天主教堂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00045",
      "start_ms": 134960,
      "end_ms": 136920,
      "text": "基督教堂挨着盖在一起，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00046",
      "start_ms": 137220,
      "end_ms": 138180,
      "text": "各过各的节，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00047",
      "start_ms": 138480,
      "end_ms": 139500,
      "text": "谁也不碍着谁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00048",
      "start_ms": 140140,
      "end_ms": 143620,
      "text": "您说这算不算一个装得下山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00049",
      "start_ms": 143940,
      "end_ms": 144880,
      "text": "装得下江，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00050",
      "start_ms": 145100,
      "end_ms": 148180,
      "text": "还装得下人间烟火的大世界。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00051",
      "start_ms": 148640,
      "end_ms": 149555,
      "text": "第三名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00052",
      "start_ms": 150400,
      "end_ms": 151140,
      "text": "虎跳峡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00053",
      "start_ms": 151780,
      "end_ms": 152920,
      "text": "云南金沙江。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00054",
      "start_ms": 153640,
      "end_ms": 154720,
      "text": "您想象一下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00055",
      "start_ms": 155140,
      "end_ms": 158660,
      "text": "两座五千多米的雪山面对面站着，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00056",
      "start_ms": 159080,
      "end_ms": 160760,
      "text": "中间只留一道缝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00057",
      "start_ms": 161380,
      "end_ms": 163760,
      "text": "金沙江被硬生生挤了进去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00058",
      "start_ms": 164540,
      "end_ms": 166020,
      "text": "左边是玉龙雪山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00059",
      "start_ms": 166520,
      "end_ms": 169620,
      "text": "右边是哈巴雪山峡谷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00060",
      "start_ms": 169660,
      "end_ms": 171060,
      "text": "全长十六公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00061",
      "start_ms": 171460,
      "end_ms": 173140,
      "text": "江水一路往下摔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00062",
      "start_ms": 173680,
      "end_ms": 175120,
      "text": "江差两百多米。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00063",
      "start_ms": 175460,
      "end_ms": 177760,
      "text": "十八处险滩接连进去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00064",
      "start_ms": 178460,
      "end_ms": 180435,
      "text": "江心有一块大石石头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00065",
      "start_ms": 181080,
      "end_ms": 184480,
      "text": "传说老虎就是踩着他跳过了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00066",
      "start_ms": 184480,
      "end_ms": 189225,
      "text": "江江面最窄的地方也就三十来米。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00067",
      "start_ms": 189760,
      "end_ms": 192490,
      "text": "您站在江边轰鸣声，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00068",
      "start_ms": 192530,
      "end_ms": 196275,
      "text": "像一列火车从脚底碾过去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00069",
      "start_ms": 196740,
      "end_ms": 199800,
      "text": "几里外都听得见雪山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00070",
      "start_ms": 199800,
      "end_ms": 201475,
      "text": "压着大江顶的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00071",
      "start_ms": 201810,
      "end_ms": 202585,
      "text": "谁也不肯让，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00072",
      "start_ms": 203200,
      "end_ms": 205615,
      "text": "就这么夹出了一条会吼的峡谷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00073",
      "start_ms": 206380,
      "end_ms": 208205,
      "text": "可就是这样的虎跳匣，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00074",
      "start_ms": 208690,
      "end_ms": 210355,
      "text": "居然还进不了前二。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00075",
      "start_ms": 210810,
      "end_ms": 215005,
      "text": "很多人心里他就是当之无愧的峡谷之王。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00076",
      "start_ms": 215750,
      "end_ms": 217415,
      "text": "长达五百零四公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00077",
      "start_ms": 217960,
      "end_ms": 219945,
      "text": "最深处达六千零九米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00078",
      "start_ms": 220410,
      "end_ms": 223395,
      "text": "环绕着七千七百多米的南加巴瓦峰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00079",
      "start_ms": 223750,
      "end_ms": 226215,
      "text": "画出了一个惊天动地的大拐弯。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00080",
      "start_ms": 226710,
      "end_ms": 231435,
      "text": "印度洋暖湿气流顺着这条世界第一大峡谷逆流而上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00081",
      "start_ms": 231880,
      "end_ms": 236345,
      "text": "在青藏高原东南原硬生生劈开了一条绿色通道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00082",
      "start_ms": 236970,
      "end_ms": 242565,
      "text": "造就了从极地冰原到热带雨林的九个完整垂直自然带。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00083",
      "start_ms": 242960,
      "end_ms": 244825,
      "text": "您站在观景台上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00084",
      "start_ms": 245360,
      "end_ms": 248145,
      "text": "脚下是奔涌咆哮的江水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00085",
      "start_ms": 248820,
      "end_ms": 251740,
      "text": "眼前是直刺蓝天的雪山，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00086",
      "start_ms": 251780,
      "end_ms": 253895,
      "text": "雄风与茫茫林海，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00087",
      "start_ms": 254310,
      "end_ms": 258195,
      "text": "他的大足以装下整座自然博物馆。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00088",
      "start_ms": 258890,
      "end_ms": 264345,
      "text": "可正因为人人都知道他天下第一真正压轴的那条，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00089",
      "start_ms": 264670,
      "end_ms": 266815,
      "text": "才更让人倒吸一口凉气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00090",
      "start_ms": 267280,
      "end_ms": 268695,
      "text": "那第一名到底是哪儿？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00091",
      "start_ms": 269180,
      "end_ms": 269975,
      "text": "先别急，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00092",
      "start_ms": 270540,
      "end_ms": 271255,
      "text": "聊到这儿，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00093",
      "start_ms": 271670,
      "end_ms": 273315,
      "text": "我先唠几句心里话。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00094",
      "start_ms": 273730,
      "end_ms": 276390,
      "text": "我发现经常有朋友留言说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00095",
      "start_ms": 276450,
      "end_ms": 277555,
      "text": "年轻时候忙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00096",
      "start_ms": 277930,
      "end_ms": 278715,
      "text": "没空出门，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00097",
      "start_ms": 279300,
      "end_ms": 281150,
      "text": "现在退休有空了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00098",
      "start_ms": 281310,
      "end_ms": 282245,
      "text": "想去走走，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00099",
      "start_ms": 282670,
      "end_ms": 285130,
      "text": "可不知道先去哪儿去了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00100",
      "start_ms": 285130,
      "end_ms": 285895,
      "text": "看什么。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00101",
      "start_ms": 286290,
      "end_ms": 287215,
      "text": "还有朋友说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00102",
      "start_ms": 287580,
      "end_ms": 290845,
      "text": "这些大峡谷大多藏在偏远的深山里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00103",
      "start_ms": 291230,
      "end_ms": 292975,
      "text": "海拔高路又远，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00104",
      "start_ms": 293570,
      "end_ms": 296145,
      "text": "这辈子怕是没几处走得进去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00105",
      "start_ms": 296760,
      "end_ms": 299255,
      "text": "有没有不用针跋山涉水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00106",
      "start_ms": 299680,
      "end_ms": 301785,
      "text": "也能把他们看明白的办法？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00107",
      "start_ms": 302230,
      "end_ms": 303870,
      "text": "还有带孙子孙女的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00108",
      "start_ms": 304250,
      "end_ms": 306190,
      "text": "想给孩子讲讲的江水，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00109",
      "start_ms": 306430,
      "end_ms": 308290,
      "text": "是怎么把大山劈开的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00110",
      "start_ms": 308610,
      "end_ms": 311210,
      "text": "这些深谷到底是怎么长出来的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00111",
      "start_ms": 311530,
      "end_ms": 313310,
      "text": "可自己也说不太明白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00112",
      "start_ms": 313730,
      "end_ms": 316070,
      "text": "您看咱们这个年纪的翻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00113",
      "start_ms": 316170,
      "end_ms": 317490,
      "text": "不光是图个热闹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00114",
      "start_ms": 317970,
      "end_ms": 320970,
      "text": "更想知道这道深谷是怎么来的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00115",
      "start_ms": 321190,
      "end_ms": 322970,
      "text": "背后有什么讲究。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00116",
      "start_ms": 322970,
      "end_ms": 327150,
      "text": "可这些东西在手机上划完就忘上网，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00117",
      "start_ms": 327210,
      "end_ms": 330330,
      "text": "查一堆乱七八糟的翻大布头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00118",
      "start_ms": 330330,
      "end_ms": 331450,
      "text": "又看的眼睛疼。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00119",
      "start_ms": 331450,
      "end_ms": 332820,
      "text": "又是前阵子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00120",
      "start_ms": 332820,
      "end_ms": 333900,
      "text": "我翻到一本书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00121",
      "start_ms": 334240,
      "end_ms": 335680,
      "text": "正好解决这个问题，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00122",
      "start_ms": 336220,
      "end_ms": 341780,
      "text": "叫大美中国人一生要去的一百零一个地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00123",
      "start_ms": 341780,
      "end_ms": 347140,
      "text": "他把全中国最值得去的一百零一个地方挑出来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00124",
      "start_ms": 347220,
      "end_ms": 349400,
      "text": "分成五块自然奇观，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00125",
      "start_ms": 349400,
      "end_ms": 351560,
      "text": "文明印记、烟火，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00126",
      "start_ms": 351600,
      "end_ms": 353000,
      "text": "人间秘境，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00127",
      "start_ms": 353000,
      "end_ms": 353480,
      "text": "寻踪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00128",
      "start_ms": 353480,
      "end_ms": 354700,
      "text": "人间天堂。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00129",
      "start_ms": 354700,
      "end_ms": 358520,
      "text": "咱们今天聊的这些大峡谷书里头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00130",
      "start_ms": 358520,
      "end_ms": 360040,
      "text": "一个地方接一个地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00131",
      "start_ms": 360100,
      "end_ms": 366160,
      "text": "将这条生生谷是怎样怎么被江水一年一年切出来的山上的冰川，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00132",
      "start_ms": 366160,
      "end_ms": 369330,
      "text": "又是怎么把谷底越拉越深的鼓里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00133",
      "start_ms": 369330,
      "end_ms": 372930,
      "text": "住着哪些人走着哪条古道几分钟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00134",
      "start_ms": 372930,
      "end_ms": 374955,
      "text": "一个地方讲的明明白白，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00135",
      "start_ms": 375710,
      "end_ms": 377305,
      "text": "图印的特别透亮。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00136",
      "start_ms": 377630,
      "end_ms": 380065,
      "text": "一页翻开就是一幅大画，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00137",
      "start_ms": 380480,
      "end_ms": 381825,
      "text": "我自己是这么用的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00138",
      "start_ms": 382090,
      "end_ms": 384840,
      "text": "能去的地方出门前翻一翻到了地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00139",
      "start_ms": 384840,
      "end_ms": 385605,
      "text": "心里有底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00140",
      "start_ms": 385890,
      "end_ms": 387795,
      "text": "看的就不只是一道深沟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00141",
      "start_ms": 388220,
      "end_ms": 391715,
      "text": "而是几千万年攒下来的一件大作品。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00142",
      "start_ms": 392170,
      "end_ms": 393345,
      "text": "暂时去不了的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00143",
      "start_ms": 393670,
      "end_ms": 395515,
      "text": "就着图文慢慢看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00144",
      "start_ms": 395850,
      "end_ms": 396795,
      "text": "也算去过了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00145",
      "start_ms": 397580,
      "end_ms": 398855,
      "text": "摆在茶几上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00146",
      "start_ms": 399380,
      "end_ms": 400465,
      "text": "孙辈来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00147",
      "start_ms": 400750,
      "end_ms": 401450,
      "text": "翻两页，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00148",
      "start_ms": 401630,
      "end_ms": 402785,
      "text": "长见识不说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00149",
      "start_ms": 403160,
      "end_ms": 405275,
      "text": "写作文也正好用得上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00150",
      "start_ms": 405690,
      "end_ms": 407670,
      "text": "老两口晚上翻翻商量，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00151",
      "start_ms": 407670,
      "end_ms": 410795,
      "text": "明年去哪儿比刷手机舒坦多了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00152",
      "start_ms": 411230,
      "end_ms": 413565,
      "text": "房子会旧积蓄会花完。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00153",
      "start_ms": 414110,
      "end_ms": 416745,
      "text": "可这些大峡谷里记着的山河来历，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00154",
      "start_ms": 417230,
      "end_ms": 419525,
      "text": "传多少代都贬不了职。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00155",
      "start_ms": 419950,
      "end_ms": 423855,
      "text": "这是大自然和老祖宗一起给咱们攒下的家底，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00156",
      "start_ms": 424390,
      "end_ms": 425375,
      "text": "一旦断了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00157",
      "start_ms": 425830,
      "end_ms": 426925,
      "text": "可就不好结了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00158",
      "start_ms": 427440,
      "end_ms": 429795,
      "text": "趁现在还能买到给自己，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00159",
      "start_ms": 429960,
      "end_ms": 431275,
      "text": "也给下一代留一份，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00160",
      "start_ms": 431700,
      "end_ms": 433225,
      "text": "说我搁商品橱窗了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00161",
      "start_ms": 433810,
      "end_ms": 436530,
      "text": "感兴趣的朋友点开我的头像，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00162",
      "start_ms": 436550,
      "end_ms": 438225,
      "text": "进入主页进去看看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00163",
      "start_ms": 438600,
      "end_ms": 440005,
      "text": "暂时走不出去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00164",
      "start_ms": 440560,
      "end_ms": 444800,
      "text": "咱就把大好河山装进屋里好说。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00165",
      "start_ms": 444800,
      "end_ms": 446620,
      "text": "回正题揭晓，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00166",
      "start_ms": 446640,
      "end_ms": 453105,
      "text": "第一名帕龙藏布大峡谷为什么是他在几乎所有人的预料里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00167",
      "start_ms": 453540,
      "end_ms": 456675,
      "text": "雅鲁藏布大峡谷都是无法撼动的榜首。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00168",
      "start_ms": 457430,
      "end_ms": 461415,
      "text": "可偏偏在很多真正走遍西藏的探险家眼里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00169",
      "start_ms": 461970,
      "end_ms": 464155,
      "text": "这条知名度极低的大峡谷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00170",
      "start_ms": 464680,
      "end_ms": 468075,
      "text": "才是全中国最不可思议的终极秘境。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00171",
      "start_ms": 468470,
      "end_ms": 470065,
      "text": "它全长七十六公里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00172",
      "start_ms": 470610,
      "end_ms": 472805,
      "text": "平均深度超过四千米。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00173",
      "start_ms": 473430,
      "end_ms": 474865,
      "text": "最核心的地方，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00174",
      "start_ms": 475180,
      "end_ms": 479895,
      "text": "他就发源并横穿于中国最大的海洋性冰川发育区。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00175",
      "start_ms": 480550,
      "end_ms": 482465,
      "text": "波密与冉吾一带，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00176",
      "start_ms": 482850,
      "end_ms": 492275,
      "text": "在他的两岸密布着米堆冰川、弱果、冰川等数十条巨大兵蛇从皑皑雪峰上一路倾泻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00177",
      "start_ms": 492810,
      "end_ms": 494650,
      "text": "甚至直接插进谷底。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00178",
      "start_ms": 494730,
      "end_ms": 497185,
      "text": "郁郁葱葱的原始云山林里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00179",
      "start_ms": 497560,
      "end_ms": 499795,
      "text": "高耸入云的极寒雪峰，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00180",
      "start_ms": 500450,
      "end_ms": 505975,
      "text": "银白夺目的世纪冰川奔腾如脱缰野马的翡翠色急流，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00181",
      "start_ms": 506440,
      "end_ms": 508945,
      "text": "加上浓得化不开的原始丛林，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00182",
      "start_ms": 509340,
      "end_ms": 513245,
      "text": "在最紧凑的空间里撞出最极致的反差。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00183",
      "start_ms": 513690,
      "end_ms": 515055,
      "text": "所以他排第一，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00184",
      "start_ms": 515650,
      "end_ms": 516925,
      "text": "不是因为他最大，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00185",
      "start_ms": 517400,
      "end_ms": 521795,
      "text": "而是因为他同时装下雪山、冰川、森林和大江。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00186",
      "start_ms": 522570,
      "end_ms": 528695,
      "text": "他把世间最壮烈、最纯粹的雪山秘境感浓缩到了极致。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00187",
      "start_ms": 529050,
      "end_ms": 531600,
      "text": "十座峡谷讲完了金丝霞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00188",
      "start_ms": 531620,
      "end_ms": 534730,
      "text": "把秦岭写成水墨小三峡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00189",
      "start_ms": 534770,
      "end_ms": 536285,
      "text": "流淌着巴楚失意，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00190",
      "start_ms": 536890,
      "end_ms": 538715,
      "text": "马岭河百铺齐飞，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00191",
      "start_ms": 539290,
      "end_ms": 540450,
      "text": "京口大峡谷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00192",
      "start_ms": 540470,
      "end_ms": 543910,
      "text": "绝壁千仞、天山红岩如烈火。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00193",
      "start_ms": 544210,
      "end_ms": 546010,
      "text": "恩施、奇峰、耸入云。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00194",
      "start_ms": 546490,
      "end_ms": 548290,
      "text": "怒江奔腾出洪荒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00195",
      "start_ms": 549010,
      "end_ms": 549790,
      "text": "虎跳峡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00196",
      "start_ms": 549850,
      "end_ms": 551750,
      "text": "在雪山下疯狂咆哮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00197",
      "start_ms": 552470,
      "end_ms": 555230,
      "text": "雅鲁藏布以六千米及深作用，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00198",
      "start_ms": 555250,
      "end_ms": 560730,
      "text": "万物可只有帕龙藏布在冰川与密林的缝隙里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00199",
      "start_ms": 561210,
      "end_ms": 564510,
      "text": "守着大自然最原始的秘境尊严。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00200",
      "start_ms": 564930,
      "end_ms": 566770,
      "text": "您说什么叫令人惊叹？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00201",
      "start_ms": 567430,
      "end_ms": 570930,
      "text": "最惊叹的往往不是世人皆知的壮阔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00202",
      "start_ms": 570930,
      "end_ms": 574040,
      "text": "而而是那些藏在天地尽头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00203",
      "start_ms": 574660,
      "end_ms": 576800,
      "text": "哪怕没被俗世记住，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00204",
      "start_ms": 577280,
      "end_ms": 580800,
      "text": "也依然美的惊心动魄的大地奇迹。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00205",
      "start_ms": 581160,
      "end_ms": 582240,
      "text": "最后问您一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00206",
      "start_ms": 582580,
      "end_ms": 583980,
      "text": "这十座大峡谷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00207",
      "start_ms": 584120,
      "end_ms": 585360,
      "text": "您去过哪几座？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00208",
      "start_ms": 585720,
      "end_ms": 588280,
      "text": "您觉得哪一座最称得上奇迹？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00209",
      "start_ms": 588660,
      "end_ms": 590740,
      "text": "刚才说的那本大美中国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00210",
      "start_ms": 591080,
      "end_ms": 592780,
      "text": "我歌商品橱窗了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00211",
      "start_ms": 593260,
      "end_ms": 594620,
      "text": "点开我的头像，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00212",
      "start_ms": 595220,
      "end_ms": 600800,
      "text": "进入主页里就能找到喜欢大山大河的朋友别错过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00213",
      "start_ms": 601260,
      "end_ms": 604465,
      "text": "想听更多藏在山河里的中国故事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00214",
      "start_ms": 604780,
      "end_ms": 605535,
      "text": "点个关注，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_8dd105b9b996aea3_s00215",
      "start_ms": 605850,
      "end_ms": 607445,
      "text": "咱们下回接着聊。"
    }
  ],
